          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        rules: {
          objective: "Score 7 or more points to 'Go' (continue for more points) or 'Stop' (end and win).",
          gameplay: "1. Match a card from your hand with a card on the table of the same month.\n2. Flip the top card of the deck; if it matches a table card, take that pair too.\n3. **The Kiss**: If you match your hand card AND the deck flip matches the same pair, it's a 'Kiss' (Sseok), and you take all three.",
          keyRules: [
            'Cards match by month (flower); capture matching cards to your area.',
            'Each turn: flip top card of stock to table, then play one card from hand; resolve captures after each step.',
            'Reach agreed target (usually 5 or 7 points) then declare Stop to win the hand or Go to continue for higher score at risk of opponent winning.',
            'Scoring from captured combinations: brights (kwang), animals (yul), ribbons (tti), junk (pi); special events (bomb, shake) apply.',
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
        strategy: {
          basic: "Prioritize 'Junk' (Pi) cards that contain the 'Shakes' or 'Bombs'. In Matgo, Junk cards are often the easiest way to hit the 7-point threshold. Don't chase Brights if you are missing the easier 10-Junk point.",
          intermediate: "The Paulownia (Dec) and Rain (Nov) months are powerful. Paulownia junk cards are doubled, and 'Rain' cards are essential for certain high-scoring Yaku. Block your opponent from completing 'Godori' (Birds) at all costs.",
          advanced: "Multipliers: If you 'Go' three times, your score is tripled. Only 'Go' if you have a guaranteed path to more points and your opponent has fewer than 5 points. If they hit 7 before you win, they 'Stop' and take all your potential winnings.",
          tips: [
            "Shake: If you have 3 cards of the same month in hand, 'Shake' them to double your points if you win.",
            "Bomb: If you have 3 cards in hand and the 4th is on the table, you can 'Bomb' it to take all and clear the space.",
          ],
          hasPlaceholders: false,
        },
